nt face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ 관생실 배정공고 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">파일 첨부</font></span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 입사 준비물 및 방법</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 신분증 : 주민등록증, 운전면허증, 여권 중 택 1 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(학생증 제외)</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 개인 비품 : 침구류, 세면도구 등 개인 생활 용품</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 입실 방법 : 입사 등록 후 입실</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 입사 등록</span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 절차 : 본인확인 → 열쇠 수령 </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 일정 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">2015. 2. 28(토) ~ 3. 1(일) 14:00~18:00</font></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 장소 : 푸름관-푸름관3동 현관</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 오름관1동-오름관 식당</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 오름관2동-오름관2동 현관</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신평관-신평관1층 현관</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 입사 기간 및 시간 외 입사 : 푸름관-3동 경비실, 오름관-방재실, 신평관-1층 현관</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 식수 혈관 등록</span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -68.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 시간 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사일 14:00～18:00, 각 관 식사시간(입사 기간 외에는 식사시간에 등록)</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 장소 : 각 관 식당</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 방법 : 신분증 제시 후 식수 혈관 등록</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 식사 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">2. 28</font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(토) 저녁부터 제공&nbsp; <font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>(5일식 신청자도 2.28~3.1 식사 가능)</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></p><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 기타 안내</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : <strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">학부</font><font color=\"#0900ff\">신입생은 2.27(금) 입사가능(신입생 OT 종료 후)</font></strong></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2015. 2. 24. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교 생활관장</span></span></p></font></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
